Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.72,TL,,0,0,0,,发球为啥喊 {\fs78}fault{\fs68}？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.72,0:00:04.08,TL,,0,0,0,,司线喊的是没做到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.83,0:00:08.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Foot fault!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N脚误！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:13.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Pretty handy if you haven't released the ball yet.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他球都还没抛出去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:16.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That AI has got to kind of calm down a bit.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个 {\fs78}AI{\fs68} 得冷静一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:18.59,TL,,0,0,0,,这是{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:20.16,TL,,0,0,0,,电子司线连喊脚误
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:22.79,TL,,0,0,0,,可发球的人连球都还没抛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:27.87,TL,,0,0,0,,发球出了问题 不管是机器还是司线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:29.81,TL,,0,0,0,,喊的都是 {\fs78}fault{\fs68} 不是 {\fs78}out{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:31.39,TL,,0,0,0,,这是为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:35.63,TL,,0,0,0,,因为 {\fs78}fault{\fs68} 说的不是球落在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:37.51,TL,,0,0,0,,而是这一发没做到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:40.63,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}fault{\fs68} 来自古法语
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.63,0:00:42.66,TL,,0,0,0,,本义是缺失 做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:44.12,TL,,0,0,0,,英语的 {\fs78}fail{\fs68} 是失败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.12,0:00:46.23,TL,,0,0,0,,网球里取消比赛资格叫 {\fs78}default{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.23,0:00:48.42,TL,,0,0,0,,都出自同一个拉丁词根
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:53.46,TL,,0,0,0,,发球的目标 是斜对面那一个发球区
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:55.91,TL,,0,0,0,,球落在发球线后面 底线前面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:58.38,TL,,0,0,0,,还在场地里 喊 {\fs78}out{\fs68} 说不通
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:04.20,TL,,0,0,0,,所以回合里的球出界 喊 {\fs78}out{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:05.71,TL,,0,0,0,,发球没落进发球区
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:07.02,TL,,0,0,0,,喊 {\fs78}fault{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:10.81,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.81,0:01:12.55,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛场上不再有司线员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:14.06,TL,,0,0,0,,电子司线接手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.06,0:01:16.91,TL,,0,0,0,,系统里预录的人声 照样分成三句
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:19.32,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}out{\fs68} {\fs78}fault{\fs68} {\fs78}foot{\fs68} {\fs78}fault{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:22.07,TL,,0,0,0,,规则里的 {\fs78}fault{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.07,0:01:23.83,TL,,0,0,0,,比发球出界宽得多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:26.72,TL,,0,0,0,,脚误 挥拍没碰到球 球先砸到网柱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.72,0:01:29.23,TL,,0,0,0,,甚至砸到自己的搭档 都算
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.97,0:01:34.17,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2018{\fs68}年温网 克耶高斯发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.17,0:01:36.03,TL,,0,0,0,,司线盯着他的脚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:40.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, he's been called. There it is.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N被判了 就是这一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:44.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, that's what he has to do.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他只能这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.55,0:01:46.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He can't call it before you hit it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你击球之前 他不能喊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.17,0:01:48.20,TL,,0,0,0,,女子巡回赛的规则书里写着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:50.23,TL,,0,0,0,,脚误要是在击球之前就喊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:52.61,TL,,0,0,0,,这一发判 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 再发一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:01:56.88,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年年终总决赛抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:59.15,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦杰夫二发被判脚误
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.15,0:02:00.92,TL,,0,0,0,,主裁看了回放
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:04.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Does the foot touch the line?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N脚碰到线了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:06.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that's tight.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 太接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:07.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You show it again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N再放一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:09.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's really tight.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真的太接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:12.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a tough judgment call, isn't it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一下很难判 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.10,0:02:17.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Has he put enough pressure onto the front part of the foot to touch the line?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他前脚掌压下去 碰到线了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:20.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, make your own mind up about that one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是不是脚误 你自己判断吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:24.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Mohamed Lahyani is sticking with the call.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N主裁拉哈亚尼维持原判
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:27.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm like, maybe I touched the line,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我心想 也许我是碰到线了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but I was so close.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可差得太少了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:31.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So I want to say, if you want to call it on the second serve,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以我想说 要在二发上判
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:34.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}make an electronic system for this.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就上电子系统吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:35.59,TL,,0,0,0,,其实就在那一年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:38.68,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网已经把脚误也交给了电子系统
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:43.40,TL,,0,0,0,,今年中网 布勃利克也被判了脚误
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's all going on.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N热闹起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:47.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}If you didn't hear, foot fault.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没听清的话 脚误
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.78,0:02:50.03,TL,,0,0,0,,这回他踩的是中点的延长线
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.03,0:02:52.40,TL,,0,0,0,,规则里 这也算脚误
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:59.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So you say it's actually the centre line?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你是说 其实是中线？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:05.30,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I played tennis 30 years.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我打了 {\fs78}30{\fs68} 年网球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:08.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The first time I hear this foot fault in my life.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这辈子头一回听说这种脚误
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:10.59,TL,,0,0,0,,一发失误 还有二发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:11.59,TL,,0,0,0,,连着两次 {\fs78}fault{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.59,0:03:13.93,TL,,0,0,0,,就是双误 直接丢一分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:21.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I can't believe what we're seeing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真不敢相信眼前这一幕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:24.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Double fault from Rublev,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N鲁布列夫双误
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:27.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}another turnaround, 5-4 deep in the third.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第三盘 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 局面又变了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:30.64,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2018{\fs68}年澳网 第三盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:33.06,TL,,0,0,0,,鲁布列夫双误 球拍遭了殃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:34.33,TL,,0,0,0,,连着两次没做到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:36.67,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分就白白送了出去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:40.28,TL,,0,0,0,,最出名的一次 {\fs78}fault{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.49,TL,,0,0,0,,在{\fs78}2009{\fs68}年美网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.49,0:03:45.10,TL,,0,0,0,,小威廉姆斯{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}30{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:47.09,TL,,0,0,0,,二发被判脚误 变成双误
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:48.73,TL,,0,0,0,,对手拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.17,TL,,0,0,0,,她对着司线怒吼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:54.75,TL,,0,0,0,,被判违反体育道德 罚一分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:56.18,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分正好是赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.18,0:03:58.06,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛就这样结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.35,TL,,0,0,0,,也有人双误{\fs78}31{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:03.93,TL,,0,0,0,,照样赢球 {\fs78}1999{\fs68}年澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.93,0:04:06.92,TL,,0,0,0,,库尔尼科娃{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘击败佐伯美穗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:10.08,TL,,0,0,0,,别的项目也用 {\fs78}fault{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:11.20,TL,,0,0,0,,羽毛球的规则里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:13.01,TL,,0,0,0,,出界 触网 发球违例
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:14.01,TL,,0,0,0,,统统叫 {\fs78}fault{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.01,0:04:16.06,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}out{\fs68} 只是其中一种
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:20.20,TL,,0,0,0,,壁球更狠 只有一次发球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:21.51,TL,,0,0,0,,失误就丢分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.51,0:04:23.14,TL,,0,0,0,,网球的职业表演赛 {\fs78}UTS{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:24.94,TL,,0,0,0,,也只给一次发球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:29.51,TL,,0,0,0,,所以 {\fs78}out{\fs68} 说的是球落在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.51,0:04:31.71,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}fault{\fs68} 说的是这一发没做到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:33.51,TL,,0,0,0,,要是网球也只给一次发球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:35.98,TL,,0,0,0,,你觉得比赛会更好看吗？
